<title>EGYPT: Egypt's Faisal bank profit up 13 pct.</title>
<headline>Egypt's Faisal bank profit up 13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the Islamic year 1417, which ended on May 7, 1997.</p>
<p>(Egyptian pounds)</p>
<p>					     1417		 1416</p>
<p>Total assets</p>
<p> (including contra accounts)  6,439,200,000     6,176,700,000</p>
<p> Revenue				423,100,000	 367,600,000</p>
<p> Net profits before tax	   309,800,000	 275,200,000</p>
<p>Full company name is Faisal Islamic Bank of Egypt .</p>
<p>Note: Under the Islamic banking system, the net profit figure includes the return on investment accounts.</p>
<p>Note: the year 1416 ended on May 18, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
